                EHM/MRO  MESSAGE NUMBERS
                ========================

MESSAGES IN THE RANGE 001 TO 199 ARE INFORMATION AND ARE WRITTEN TO
THE RUN LOG.  MESSAGES FROM 900 UPWARDS ARE ERRORS AND ARE ALSO
WRITTEN TO THE ERROR STREAM SO THAT THEY APPEAR IN THE BATCH LISTING.
A RETIRED NUMBER IS NEVER REUSED.

NUMBER   TEXT AND OPERATOR ACTION
------   ---------------------------------------------------------

EHM-001  RELEASE NN OF DD-MMM-YY STARTED
         NORMAL.  WRITTEN AT THE HEAD OF EVERY RUN.

EHM-002  RUN COMPLETE, N MESSAGES, N ERRORS
         NORMAL.  THE ERROR COUNT IS ALSO THE EXIT STATUS.

EHM-100  RUN DATE YYMMDD, MODE BATCH OR TERMINAL
         NORMAL.

EHM-101  FLEET MASTER LOADED, N ENGINES, N REJECTED
         A NON ZERO REJECT COUNT MEANS CARDS WITH A BLANK SERIAL
         NUMBER.  PASS THE COUNT TO THE RECORDS OFFICE.

EHM-102  FLIGHT REPORTS LOADED, N RECORDS, N UNKNOWN ENGINES
         UNKNOWN ENGINES ARE NORMAL IN SMALL NUMBERS.  A SUDDEN RISE
         MEANS THE FLEET MASTER IS STALE.

EHM-103  SLOT FILE LOADED, N SLOTS
         NORMAL.

EHM-104  TREND SWEEP COMPLETE, N ENGINES, N ALERTS
         NORMAL.

EHM-105  NO WORKSHOP SLOTS LOADED, PLAN WILL BE EMPTY
         THE SLOT FILE WAS EMPTY.  CHASE FLEET PLANNING FOR THE WEEK.

EHM-106  ENGINE NNNNNNNN NO SLOT AVAILABLE, PRIORITY N
         THE PLAN IS SHORT OF BAYS.  THE ENGINE IS STILL LISTED WITH
         THE SLOT FIELDS BLANK.  REFER TO THE DUTY PLANNER.

EHM-107  INDUCTION PLAN BUILT, N CANDIDATES, N PLACED
         NORMAL.

EHM-108  RUN DATE SET TO YYMMDD
         NORMAL.  THE TREND SWEEP MUST BE RERUN AFTER THIS.

EHM-901  CANNOT OPEN RUN LOG
         CHECK THE PROTECTION ON EHM.LOG.  THE RUN CONTINUES WITH
         TERMINAL OUTPUT ONLY.

EHM-910  CANNOT OPEN FLEET MASTER
EHM-915  CANNOT OPEN FLIGHT REPORT FILE
EHM-918  CANNOT OPEN SLOT FILE
         CHECK EHMDATA AND THE DATA SET NAMES.

EHM-911  FLEET MASTER TRUNCATED AT N ENGINES
EHM-916  FLIGHT REPORTS TRUNCATED AT N RECORDS
EHM-919  SLOT FILE TRUNCATED AT N SLOTS
EHM-923  PLAN TRUNCATED AT N LINES
         A TABLE LIMIT IN INCLUDE/EHM.H HAS BEEN REACHED.  THE RUN
         COMPLETES ON THE RECORDS LOADED SO FAR.  RAISE THE LIMIT AND
         REBUILD, WATCHING THE CORE SIZE.

EHM-912  ENGINE NNNNNNNN BAD STATUS CODE, TAKEN AS S
EHM-913  ENGINE NNNNNNNN SHOP VISIT DUE DATE MISSING
EHM-917  ENGINE NNNNNNNN FLIGHT NNNNNN BAD DATE, RECORD DROPPED
EHM-920  SLOT CARD REJECTED
         BAD DATA ON THE CARD.  REPORT TO THE RECORDS OFFICE WITH THE
         CARD IMAGE FROM THE LOG.

EHM-914  FLEET MASTER MUST BE LOADED FIRST
EHM-921  NO FLEET LOADED, NOTHING TO CALCULATE
EHM-922  TREND SWEEP MUST BE RUN BEFORE SCHEDULING
EHM-930  NO FLEET LOADED, REPORT ABANDONED
EHM-931  TREND SWEEP MUST BE RUN BEFORE THIS REPORT
EHM-932  NO INDUCTION PLAN HAS BEEN BUILT
         MENU OPTIONS TAKEN OUT OF ORDER.  RUN 1, THEN 2, THEN 3.

EHM-933  ENGINE NNNNNNNN IS NOT IN THE FLEET MASTER
         CHECK THE SERIAL NUMBER KEYED.

EHM-940  CANNOT OPEN PRINT FILE
         OUTPUT REVERTS TO THE TERMINAL.

EHM-941  RUN DATE MUST BE SIX DIGITS
EHM-942  OPTION NOT RECOGNISED
EHM-943  UNEXPECTED ARGUMENT
EHM-944  RUN DATE MUST BE YYMMDD
EHM-945  OPTION NOT KNOWN
EHM-946  OPTION REQUIRES A VALUE
         OPERATOR ERROR.  SEE THE USAGE LINE FROM EHM -H.
